   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Track B: H3 generates real HDR (log-native LoRA)\n\nThe HDR LoRA (`h3_hdr_log_acescct_v1`, trained with docs/research/l9178_h3_hdr_log_lora.yaml) makes H3 generate ACEScct LOG pictures: flat and grey on screen, which is correct.\n\n- **H3 HDR Roundtrip** (to_scene, code_space ACEScct) decodes them to ACEScg scene-linear and reports stops above white + a fake-HDR footroom check.\n- **Save Video (C2C)** writes ARRI LogC3 (EI800) 16-bit DPX (switch to EXR half for ACEScg linear).\n- Image-to-video: the first frame must be LOG too - plate EXR -> H3 HDR Roundtrip (to_view, ACEScct) -> first_frame.\n\nCore's H3 graph copied from the official blueprint. Experimental: not run on a GPU yet (ledger L9.178)."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## Track B: H3 generates real HDR (log-native LoRA)\n\nThe HDR LoRA (`h3_hdr_log_acescct_v1`, trained with docs/research/l9178_h3_hdr_log_lora.yaml) makes H3 generate ACEScct LOG pictures: flat and grey on screen, which is correct.\n\n- **H3 HDR Roundtrip** (to_scene, code_space ACEScct) decodes them to ACEScg scene-linear and reports stops above white + a fake-HDR footroom check.\n- **Save Video (C2C)** writes ARRI LogC3 (EI800) 16-bit DPX (switch to EXR half for ACEScg linear).\n- Image-to-video: the first frame must be LOG too - plate EXR -> H3 HDR Roundtrip (to_view, ACEScct) -> first_frame.\n\nCore's H3 graph copied from the official blueprint. Experimental: not run on a GPU yet (ledger L9.178)."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
